表现为覆膜纸牌材质。\n\n邀请函表现为黑金烫金材质，增加金属反光与轻微辉光。\n\n增加桌面对酒杯、扑克牌和邀请函的反射。\n\n增强空间层次与画面完成度。\n\n整体氛围保持优雅、危险、神秘的赌局邀请感。\n\n最终效果类似商业级视觉小说主视觉CG，在保持原画风格的前提下提升完成度。","sender":"me","time":"11:30","timestamp":1781667051844,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9483},{"id":1781667026382,"text":"[圖片]","image":"[omitted: large string payload]","sender":"me","time":"11:31","timestamp":1781667062541,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9485},{"id":1781667026384,"text":"> ✅ 绘图已完成","rawContent":"> ✅ 绘图已完成","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:33","timestamp":1781667186703,"roundId":"round_1781667063780_bbi8e5euz","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9486},{"id":1781667026385,"text":"!","rawContent":"!","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:33","timestamp":1781667187297,"roundId":"round_1781667063780_bbi8e5euz","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9487},{"id":1781667026386,"text":"(https://oss.filenest.top/uploads/8c0633d5-fc0c-4373-aaf1-5d473f9a61b3.png)","rawContent":"(https://oss.filenest.top/uploads/8c0633d5-fc0c-4373-aaf1-5d473f9a61b3.png)","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:33","timestamp":1781667190077,"roundId":"round_1781667063780_bbi8e5euz","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9488},{"id":1781667207669,"text":"[圖片]","image":"[omitted: large string payload]","sender":"me","time":"11:34","timestamp":1781667298051,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9490},{"id":1781667207674,"text":"这是一次插画收尾与完善任务，不是重新设计画面。\n\n保留原有构图、人物造型、线稿、机械臂结构、扑克牌摆